msgid "_Paste the Chosen Item"
msgstr "_Klistra in det valda objektet"

#: src/deskence/ui/clipboard-page.ui:26
msgid ""
"Pastes into the window you were in, with Ctrl+V (Ctrl+Shift+V in terminals). "
"When off, the item is only put on the clipboard."
msgstr ""
"Klistrar in i fönstret du var i, med Ctrl+V (Ctrl+Skift+V i terminaler). När "
"av läggs objektet bara i urklipp."

